cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DexLab in your work, please cite this repository."
title: "DexLab: Robotics Simulation Solver Diagnosis and Selection"
abstract: >-
  DexLab is a personal research project that uses controlled simulation
  experiments to diagnose contact and friction behavior and improve the
  fidelity of robotics simulation.
